<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Towards Temporal Knowledge-Base Creation for Fine-Grained Opinion Analysis with Language Models</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author"><span class="ltx_annotated_personname">
